@startuml
title SD-UI08 — Merchant operations and reporting
caption To-Be draft | F08 · Frontend · Merchant /merchant/work and /merchant/reports
actor User
boundary "Route and WorkQueue, AuditHistory and SalesReport" as UI
participant "Shared API client" as Client
participant "Authorized API" as API
User -> UI : Open view or submit action
UI -> Client : admin work, order or event details and reports
Client -> API : Fetch or submit with applicable guards
alt Success
 API --> Client : Current typed result
 Client --> UI : Render or refresh authoritative data
else unauthorized or invalid date range
 API --> Client : Typed failure
 Client --> UI : Deny or request a bounded range
end
@enduml
